!Name: turners-c2-general
!C General-period glider turners for c/2 rakes,
!C labeled with the minumum period for which they work.
!C These can be used to build a forward rake using
!C multiple backward rakes, or vice versa.
!C
!C These reactions work for any period, but note that
!C for most periods, there are more-efficient ways to
!C turn gliders than this.
!Source: jslife-moving
